# The mock WebUI is a "no build step, serve static files only" demo.
# The prebuilt admin-spa/dist/bundle.js IS the deliverable here, not throwaway
# build output, so override the repo-root `dist/` ignore rule for this subtree.
# Without this, a fresh clone / systemd boot would serve index.html that
# references a missing bundle.js -> blank screen.
!admin-spa/dist/
!admin-spa/dist/**
